Package: instability
Type: Package
Title: UV and Desiccation Instability Computation
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Sajad",
    family = "Shahbazi",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "sajad642008@gmail.com"
  )
Description: Provides the validated ultraviolet and desiccation Instability
    computation for already-preprocessed variance-stabilized expression data
    and associated metadata. Raw-count preprocessing, normalization, and
    variance-stabilizing transformation are outside the package scope.
